\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.45</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. εἴς τινα</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">active merit, good service</b> done him, <span class=\"gk\">ἐς τοὺς Ἕλληνας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.58</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.40</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. περί τινα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.4.8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀνταποδοῦναι ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.19</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀρετὰς παρασχέσθαι ὑπέρ τινος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.312</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀρετῆς ἕνεκα,</span> freq. in honorary Inscrr., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.107.14</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">reward</b> of excellence, <b class=\"lex-tr\">distinction, fame,</b> <span class=\"gk\">πλούτῳ δ' ἀρετὴ καὶ κῦδος ὀπηδεῖ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Op.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">313</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sapph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">80</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.53</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">ἀθάνατος ἀ.</span> <span class=